<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian African Paints makes loss in 96.</title>
<headline>Nigerian African Paints makes loss in 96.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year results for Nigerian African Paints to December 31 1996, published on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			     (In million naira)</p>
<p>			     1996			 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    180			  150</p>
<p>Profit after tax	  (41)			  16</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it was the first time it failed to make a profit in 20 years and blamed harsh economic conditions and heavy competition for the loss.</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
